docs: audit of where the app stands and what shipping needs (2026-08-23)

Three read-only audits (signed-in UI, tutor arc, gap to shipping) plus the
day's live findings, in one document with a proposed order of work and the
decisions it needs. Also fixes two doc contradictions the audit caught: the
debit seam is the Convex HTTP action, not a Next.js endpoint, and the
token-route gating is not yet built.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
